{
  "format": 1,
  "name": "lot_developer_lot_foundation",
  "spec": ["lot-developer 17.5", "lot-developer 10.2", "lot-developer 16"],
  "description": "Tests 32 and 33 (§17.5.4 worked example 3, R8). Test 32: lot (4, 4, 5, 5), facing 0, configuration not water-compatible, no lot around it, vertex altitudes (rows z = 4, 5, 6; columns x = 4, 5, 6) 100 101 102.5 / 100 101 103 / 100 101 104. Slot 54 AddLotFoundation(lot, cfg, false, true, true) with no primary foundation object takes the default type 0x890B7312 without a draw, then slot 55: centre (80, ., 80), dx = dz = 32, bottom 100 (lowest vertex), hi 104, corners [100, 102.5, 104, 100], top = 100 + 2.5 * 0.5 = 101.25; the lot is 2 cells wide, so no slot 19; slot 20 -> ModifyTerrainHeight(1, 1, 4, 4, 6, 6, 101.25, lot, 5, null) writes all 9 vertices to 101.25 (x outer); BDS slot 23 (0x890B7312, 2, (80, 101.25, 80), 32, 32, 0, 100): world rectangle (64.5, 64.5, 95.5, 95.5), cells (4, 4, 5, 5), size (32, 1.25, 32); the lot's altitude becomes 101.25 and its flags (old & ~4) | 3 (12 -> 11); 101.25 < 104 so AddRetainingWallOccupant(lot, 1), the surrounding lot foundations (none here) and UpdateSurroundingRetainingWalls(lot) follow, in that order. Facings 1, 2, 3 give tops 103.25, 102, 100 (facing 3: 100 < 104, walls added). With useLotAltitude = true and lot altitude 104 the corners are not read (18 vertex reads: slot 17 lowest and highest; 22 with the corners), the top is 104 and there are no walls. A 3 x 3 lot with level calls slot 19 with target top - 0.5 and force = true (four single-vertex calls) before slot 20. Test 33: file RNG seeded 12345 (first raw 0x0C63D3DC): a primary foundation object with IDs {A, B, C} draws once, Uniform(3) = 0 -> type A; IDs empty and +0x20 = T -> no draw, type T; no primary foundation object -> no draw, type 0x890B7312; type 0 -> AL = 0 and no slot 55 (no BDS call). UpdateLotFoundation (slot 61) on a lot with flags bit 0 and no foundation occupant draws once (the second raw of the stream: Uniform(3) = 2, type C), through slot 54, and keeps the lot's altitude as the top (no levelling, no walls).",
  "steps": [
    {"op": "ldev_terrain", "flat": 100, "vertex": [
      [4, 4, 100], [5, 4, 101], [6, 4, 102.5],
      [4, 5, 100], [5, 5, 101], [6, 5, 103],
      [4, 6, 100], [5, 6, 101], [6, 6, 104]]},
    {"op": "ldev_cfg", "id": 9, "w": 2, "h": 2, "water": false, "primary_foundation": null},
    {"op": "ldev_lot", "id": 1, "x": 4, "z": 4, "w": 2, "h": 2, "state": 2, "cfg": 9, "facing": 0, "flags": 12},
    {"op": "ldev_create", "seed": 12345},
    {"op": "ldev_init", "expect": true},
    {"op": "ldev_expect_draws", "draws": []},

    {"op": "ldev_clear_events"},
    {"op": "ldev_add_lot_foundation", "lot": 1, "cfg": 9, "use_lot_altitude": false, "level": true, "walls": true, "expect": true},
    {"op": "ldev_expect_events", "events": [
      {"event": "modify_terrain", "per_vertex": true, "rect": [4, 4, 6, 6], "h": 101.25, "exempt": 1},
      {"event": "set_altitude", "x": 4, "z": 4, "h": 101.25}, {"event": "set_altitude", "x": 4, "z": 5, "h": 101.25},
      {"event": "set_altitude", "x": 4, "z": 6, "h": 101.25}, {"event": "set_altitude", "x": 5, "z": 4, "h": 101.25},
      {"event": "set_altitude", "x": 5, "z": 5, "h": 101.25}, {"event": "set_altitude", "x": 5, "z": 6, "h": 101.25},
      {"event": "set_altitude", "x": 6, "z": 4, "h": 101.25}, {"event": "set_altitude", "x": 6, "z": 5, "h": 101.25},
      {"event": "set_altitude", "x": 6, "z": 6, "h": 101.25},
      {"event": "redisplay", "rect": [3, 3, 7, 7], "reason": 5},
      {"event": "add_foundation", "type": "0x890B7312", "kind": 2, "pos": [80, 101.25, 80], "dx": 32, "dz": 32, "orient": 0,
        "bottom": 100, "size": [32, 1.25, 32], "cells": [4, 4, 5, 5]},
      {"event": "retaining_wall", "lot": 1, "flag": 1},
      {"event": "update_surrounding_walls", "lot": 1}]},
    {"op": "ldev_expect_lot", "lot": 1, "altitude": 101.25, "flags": 11},
    {"op": "ldev_expect_draws", "draws": []},

    {"op": "ldev_terrain", "reset": true, "vertex": [
      [4, 4, 100], [5, 4, 101], [6, 4, 102.5], [4, 5, 100], [5, 5, 101], [6, 5, 103], [4, 6, 100], [5, 6, 101], [6, 6, 104]]},
    {"op": "ldev_lot", "id": 1, "facing": 1, "flags": 0},
    {"op": "ldev_add_lot_foundation", "lot": 1, "type": "0x890B7312", "use_lot_altitude": false, "level": false, "walls": true, "expect": true},
    {"op": "ldev_expect_events", "filter": {"event": "add_foundation"}, "events": [{"pos": [80, 103.25, 80], "orient": 1}]},
    {"op": "ldev_lot", "id": 1, "facing": 2},
    {"op": "ldev_add_lot_foundation", "lot": 1, "type": "0x890B7312", "use_lot_altitude": false, "level": false, "walls": true, "expect": true},
    {"op": "ldev_expect_events", "filter": {"event": "add_foundation"}, "events": [{"pos": [80, 102, 80], "orient": 2}]},
    {"op": "ldev_lot", "id": 1, "facing": 3},
    {"op": "ldev_add_lot_foundation", "lot": 1, "type": "0x890B7312", "use_lot_altitude": false, "level": false, "walls": true, "expect": true},
    {"op": "ldev_expect_events", "events": [
      {"event": "add_foundation", "pos": [80, 100, 80], "orient": 3, "bottom": 100, "size": [32, 0.5, 32]},
      {"event": "retaining_wall", "lot": 1, "flag": 1},
      {"event": "update_surrounding_walls", "lot": 1}]},

    {"op": "ldev_lot", "id": 1, "facing": 0, "altitude": 104},
    {"op": "ldev_world", "trace_terrain": true},
    {"op": "ldev_add_lot_foundation", "lot": 1, "type": "0x890B7312", "use_lot_altitude": true, "level": false, "walls": true, "expect": true},
    {"op": "ldev_expect_event_count", "filter": {"event": "alt_vertex"}, "count": 18},
    {"op": "ldev_expect_events", "filter": {"event": "add_foundation"}, "events": [{"pos": [80, 104, 80], "size": [32, 4, 32]}]},
    {"op": "ldev_add_lot_foundation", "lot": 1, "type": "0x890B7312", "use_lot_altitude": false, "level": false, "walls": false, "expect": true},
    {"op": "ldev_expect_event_count", "filter": {"event": "alt_vertex"}, "count": 22},
    {"op": "ldev_expect_events", "filter": {"event": "retaining_wall"}, "events": [], "note": "walls false: none even though 101.25 < 104"},
    {"op": "ldev_world", "trace_terrain": false},

    {"op": "ldev_terrain", "reset": true},
    {"op": "ldev_lot", "id": 2, "x": 10, "z": 10, "w": 3, "h": 3, "state": 2, "cfg": 9, "facing": 0, "flags": 0},
    {"op": "ldev_add_lot_foundation", "lot": 2, "type": "0x890B7312", "use_lot_altitude": false, "level": true, "walls": true, "expect": true},
    {"op": "ldev_expect_events", "filter": {"event": "modify_terrain"},
      "note": "flat 100: top 100; slot 19 (target 99.5, force) on the four interior vertices, then slot 20 over every vertex at 100",
      "events": [
        {"rect": [11, 11, 11, 11], "h": 99.5, "exempt": 2}, {"rect": [11, 12, 11, 12], "h": 99.5, "exempt": 2},
        {"rect": [12, 11, 12, 11], "h": 99.5, "exempt": 2}, {"rect": [12, 12, 12, 12], "h": 99.5, "exempt": 2},
        {"rect": [10, 10, 13, 13], "h": 100, "exempt": 2}]},
    {"op": "ldev_expect_terrain", "vertex": [[11, 11, 100], [12, 12, 100]]},

    {"op": "ldev_terrain", "reset": true},
    {"op": "ldev_cfg", "id": 10, "w": 1, "h": 1, "primary_foundation": ["0xA0000001", "0xA0000002", "0xA0000003"]},
    {"op": "ldev_lot", "id": 3, "x": 20, "z": 20, "state": 2, "cfg": 10, "flags": 0},
    {"op": "ldev_rng", "seed": 12345},
    {"op": "ldev_expect_draws", "draws": []},
    {"op": "ldev_add_lot_foundation", "lot": 3, "cfg": 10, "expect": true},
    {"op": "ldev_expect_draws", "draws": [["R8", 3, 0]]},
    {"op": "ldev_expect_events", "filter": {"event": "add_foundation"}, "events": [{"type": "0xA0000001", "kind": 2}]},

    {"op": "ldev_cfg", "id": 10, "primary_foundation": {"ids": [], "foundation": "0xB0000005"}},
    {"op": "ldev_add_lot_foundation", "lot": 3, "cfg": 10, "expect": true},
    {"op": "ldev_expect_draws", "draws": []},
    {"op": "ldev_expect_events", "filter": {"event": "add_foundation"}, "events": [{"type": "0xB0000005"}]},

    {"op": "ldev_cfg", "id": 10, "primary_foundation": null},
    {"op": "ldev_add_lot_foundation", "lot": 3, "cfg": 10, "expect": true},
    {"op": "ldev_expect_draws", "draws": []},
    {"op": "ldev_expect_events", "filter": {"event": "add_foundation"}, "events": [{"type": "0x890B7312"}]},

    {"op": "ldev_cfg", "id": 10, "primary_foundation": {"ids": [], "foundation": 0}},
    {"op": "ldev_lot", "id": 3, "flags": 0},
    {"op": "ldev_add_lot_foundation", "lot": 3, "cfg": 10, "expect": false},
    {"op": "ldev_add_lot_foundation", "lot": 3, "cfg": null, "expect": false, "note": "a null configuration: 0"},
    {"op": "ldev_expect_draws", "draws": []},
    {"op": "ldev_expect_events", "events": []},
    {"op": "ldev_expect_lot", "lot": 3, "flags": 0},

    {"op": "ldev_cfg", "id": 10, "primary_foundation": ["0xA0000001", "0xA0000002", "0xA0000003"]},
    {"op": "ldev_lot", "id": 4, "x": 30, "z": 30, "state": 3, "cfg": 10, "flags": 1, "altitude": 120},
    {"op": "ldev_update_lot_foundation", "lot": 4, "expect": true},
    {"op": "ldev_expect_draws", "draws": [["R8", 3, 2]]},
    {"op": "ldev_expect_events", "note": "slot 54 -> slot 55 with useLotAltitude: top 120, no levelling, no walls",
      "events": [{"event": "add_foundation", "type": "0xA0000003", "kind": 2, "pos": [488, 120, 488], "bottom": 100, "size": [16, 20, 16]}]},
    {"op": "ldev_expect_lot", "lot": 4, "flags": 3, "altitude": 120}
  ]
